  "body": "Step into this newly completed home in Silverdale, where modern design, comfort and thoughtful spaces come together to create an inviting environment for family living. Offering four bedrooms, three bathrooms, two living areas and an internal-access garage, this home delivers the flexibility today's families appreciate.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the ground floor, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a welcoming space for everyday life. Whether preparing dinner, enjoying time with family or entertaining friends, the layout keeps everyone connected. Sliding doors extend the living space onto a generous outdoor deck, perfect for weekend barbecues or relaxed afternoons.\r\n\r\nA ground-floor bedroom and full bathroom provide added convenience, particularly for extended family, visiting guests or anyone who prefers to avoid stairs. This versatile space could also serve as a home office.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master bedroom offers a private retreat with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Two further bedrooms share a family bathroom, while an additional family lounge provides a comfortable space for children, movie nights or quiet relaxation.\r\n\r\nAn internal-access single garage and easy-care outdoor areas complete the home, making everyday living both practical and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nSituated in the growing Silverdale community, the property enjoys convenient access to shopping, supermarkets, cafes, local schools and motorway connections. The beautiful beaches and recreational attractions of the Hibiscus Coast are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nCombining the appeal of a newly completed home with a versatile family-friendly layout, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or to arrange a private viewing.",
